                                                "sense_id": "499fc11b-5b93-31b4-bfc8-c75ae135a31b",
                                                "text": "At the age of 22, the Norwegian forward had already established himself as one of the best goalscorers in European football – first at Red Bull Salzburg, then with two prolific seasons at Borussia Dortmund."
                                            }
                                        ]
